  "notes": {
    "raw": "Phase change: 933.61 K, melting point of Al; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.580$ kcal/mol \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 19.370 + 0.314 \\times 10^{-3} T - 2.639 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=19.370\\times10^{-3}T+0.157\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+2.639\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-6.674$ \nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-933.61 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = -7.396 + 1.843 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 3.617 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 230.400 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -7.396 - 1.843 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 3.617 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 115.200 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 7.172 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n933.61-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = -9.931 - 4.153 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.163 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 195.600 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -9.931 + 4.153 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.163 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 97.800 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 27.875 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \nSource: Data from Gurvich (50). ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "Phase change: 933.61 K, melting point of Al; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.580$ kcal/mol",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 19.370 + 0.314 \\times 10^{-3} T - 2.639 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$",
      "$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=19.370\\times10^{-3}T+0.157\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+2.639\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-6.674$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "298.15-933.61 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = -7.396 + 1.843 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 3.617 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 230.400 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -7.396 - 1.843 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 3.617 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 115.200 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 7.172 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "933.61-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = -9.931 - 4.153 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.163 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 195.600 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -9.931 + 4.153 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.163 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 97.800 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 27.875 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "Source: Data from Gurvich (50)."
